GameGuardian 101.4 - open source reconstruction
==============================================

Copyright (c) 2026 the authors of this reconstruction.

This repository contains a reconstruction of the Android application
"GameGuardian" (package catch_.me_.if_.you_.can_, version 101.4) that was
produced by static analysis of the original APK.

GameGuardian is a commercial product.  The original program, its name, its
trademarks and the copyright in the underlying code belong to GameGuardian
Ltd.  No part of the original binary is redistributed with this repository,
and no affiliation with or endorsement by GameGuardian Ltd. is claimed.

The build tooling in tools/lib/ is redistributed under the Apache License
2.0 (smali and baksmali, https://github.com/JesusFreke/smali); the remaining
tooling and the reconstruction itself are provided for educational and
interoperability purposes.

The project signing key in keystore/release.jks is a project local key.  It
signs the artefacts published from this repository and must not be used for
anything else.